Note on the copyright line (anon.md RP-9)

The holder reads "Anonymous Author" because this repository accompanies a
double-blind submission. That is a placeholder for the review period, not a
disclaimer of authorship: it will be replaced with the real copyright holder in
the camera-ready release, and the licence terms themselves are unaffected by the
substitution.

The dataset under `data/` is synthetic and generated by `data/script.py` in this
repository (recorded as `generator_script` in `data/dataset_meta.json`); it is
covered by the same licence. No third-party dataset, pretrained checkpoint or
model weight is redistributed here.
